# Code style for the C/C++ (Arduino .ino/.h) sources, written for clang-format 19.
# Apply with: clang-format -i --assume-filename=x.cpp <file>
# (.ino is not a C++ extension clang-format recognises on its own.)
---
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
UseTab: Never
IndentWidth: 2
TabWidth: 2
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: false
IndentCaseLabels: false
ColumnLimit: 0
SortIncludes: Never
...
